    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the Supernatural Siege</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Phandom: Demon Siege</strong> is a third-person shooter set in a world overrun by demonic creatures and supernatural entities. Blending intense action with stage-based progression, the game delivers an experience focused on tension, exploration, and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against <strong>werewolves, demons, grotesque monsters, and twisted abominations</strong> as you move through corrupted environments, scavenging for weapons and essential items in a desperate fight to stay alive. The campaign unfolds across atmospheric and dangerous maps that push your skills to the limit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Third-Person Shooter with Tactical Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim with precision, manage your resources, and fight for survival in brutal encounters against supernatural horrors.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Face the Inferno</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to confront terrifying enemies: demons, cursed entities, werewolves, and unspeakable horrors that defy logic.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stage-Based Progression with Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore every environment for weapons, ammo, and crucial items. Each stage brings new challenges, hidden dangers, and dark secrets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Experimental Co-Op Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play online with friends in the early co-op mode. However, the game is designed with a strong focus on <strong>single-player</strong>, where tension and difficulty shine.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dark and Immersive Atmosphere</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oppressive environments, a grim visual design, and an eerie soundtrack set the tone for a journey through a world on the brink of spiritual collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You're alone. Or almost.<br>Survive. Shoot. Push forward.<br>Hell is unleashed \u2014 and it's coming for you.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the Supernatural Siege</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Phandom: Demon Siege</strong> is a third-person shooter set in a world overrun by demonic creatures and supernatural entities. Blending intense action with stage-based progression, the game delivers an experience focused on tension, exploration, and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against <strong>werewolves, demons, grotesque monsters, and twisted abominations</strong> as you move through corrupted environments, scavenging for weapons and essential items in a desperate fight to stay alive. The campaign unfolds across atmospheric and dangerous maps that push your skills to the limit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Third-Person Shooter with Tactical Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim with precision, manage your resources, and fight for survival in brutal encounters against supernatural horrors.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Face the Inferno</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to confront terrifying enemies: demons, cursed entities, werewolves, and unspeakable horrors that defy logic.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stage-Based Progression with Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore every environment for weapons, ammo, and crucial items. Each stage brings new challenges, hidden dangers, and dark secrets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Experimental Co-Op Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play online with friends in the early co-op mode. However, the game is designed with a strong focus on <strong>single-player</strong>, where tension and difficulty shine.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dark and Immersive Atmosphere</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oppressive environments, a grim visual design, and an eerie soundtrack set the tone for a journey through a world on the brink of spiritual collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You're alone. Or almost.<br>Survive. Shoot. Push forward.<br>Hell is unleashed \u2014 and it's coming for you.</strong></p>",
